Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:11.01,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.35,0:00:03.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most borrowers meet their liquidation line
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.19,0:00:04.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the worst possible day:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.95,0:00:07.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,the day the market finds it for them.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.46,0:00:09.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,MintAnchor lets you find it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:28.61,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Paste any Mezo address.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.03,0:00:15.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,The X-Ray reads the live trove
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.21,0:00:16.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,from the chain itself:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.81,0:00:19.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,over seven thousand bitcoin of collateral,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.86,0:00:22.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,nearly one point four million MUSD of debt,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.99,0:00:24.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a liquidation price
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.66,0:00:26.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,of two hundred fifteen dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:47.62,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.96,0:00:31.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Or build your own position.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two bitcoin against fifty thousand MUSD.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.62,0:00:36.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now drag the price down,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.65,0:00:39.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watch the band fall with it:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,safe, then watch, then danger,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.90,0:00:45.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,closing on the one hundred ten percent line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:01:07.73,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.97,0:00:50.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Looping multiplies everything:
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.38,0:00:52.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,the gains and the risk together.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.94,0:00:55.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four loops at fifty percent each.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Leverage over five times.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.59,0:01:00.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Liquidation just twelve percent
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,below the live price.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,One bad day ends it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.36,0:01:06.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rehearsed here, before any real loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:27.62,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,A check you cannot find again
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.49,0:01:11.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,is just a rumour.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,So save it on chain:
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.56,0:01:16.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,ratio, liquidation price, band and label,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,written to the MintAnchor registry
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.79,0:01:21.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,on Mezo testnet.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Signed by the demo wallet,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.28,0:01:25.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,and labelled as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:41.60,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.97,0:01:30.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every result becomes a card,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.56,0:01:33.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,ready to share: the position,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.24,0:01:35.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,the drop, the verdict.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your risk, in one picture,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.68,0:01:39.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,watermark and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:57.99,WM,,0,0,0,,@heisdave01 / DEXTER WEB3
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.95,0:01:42.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,MintAnchor.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Stress-test your MUSD position
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.52,0:01:47.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,before the market does.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.53,0:01:51.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,Built for the Mezo Buildathon, Wave Two.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Live on testnet: no real funds,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.72,0:01:55.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,and not financial advice.
